    "result_text": "The exploration agent's report confirms the approach I already implemented and verified \u2014 it matches exactly: a `RejectDuplicateEmail` step mirroring `RejectDuplicateTelephone`, a checked `DuplicateEmailException`, a `DuplicateEmailHandler` returning 409, the escalation YAML, and wiring into `owners.POST.yml` after `normalizeEmail`. The implementation is complete and the full test suite is green.\n\nThe change is done:\n\n- **`RejectDuplicateEmail.java`** \u2014 scans `ownerRepository.findAll()`, comparing the request's lower-cased email against each existing owner's lower-cased email; skips when email is null; throws `DuplicateEmailException` on collision.\n- **`DuplicateEmailException.java`** \u2014 checked exception.\n- **`DuplicateEmailHandler.java`** \u2014 responds **409 CONFLICT**.\n- **`...DuplicateEmailException.yml`** \u2014 maps the exception to the handler.\n- **`owners.POST.yml`** \u2014 new `rejectDuplicateEmail` step inserted after `normalizeEmail` (which lower-cases the email) and before `rejectDuplicateTelephone`.\n\n`./mvnw -o test` \u2192 **BUILD SUCCESS**, `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` (including the new `coreRejectsDuplicateEmail` acceptance test).",
